<title>HONG KONG: Henderson Land interim net up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Henderson Land interim net up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   319.0  vs  251.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     70.0  vs  60.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			 5,318.03  vs  4,011.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		 10,300.27  vs  6,840.93</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson Land Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		April 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 May 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson Land is an investment holding, construction, property management and finance company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
